  <item>
    <title>Vol.24 脆皮打工人学养生，多活一天是一天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f7382f6764957079e3ab16</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f7382f6764957079e3ab16</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和当代千千万万脆皮年轻人一样，白子王马和didi也在年纪轻轻时就跨入亚健康的阶段，经历了“质疑养生，理解养生，爱上养生”的转变之后，我们来聊聊亲自试验有效的养生tips，也欢迎大家在评论区分享有用的养生之道，希望朋友们一起变美变帅变健康！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】白子王马/didi</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】《Good as you》—— Kane Brown</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 偏头痛、尿酸高、缺乏维D、甘油三酯低...当代年轻人亚健康之症也太多了吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> 鱼油、叶黄素、逍遥丸、五红片、艾草贴...中西保健双管齐下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 在国外得了急性肠胃炎无法就医，某红书上学的穴位按摩法真的有用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 白子王马腰痛难忍，针灸后立马“回光返照”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 在北京的朋友有福了，didi倾情推荐自己最爱的推拿足疗按摩店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 少吃糖，变漂亮～只有低GI饮食才能抗炎抗衰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> Lamer和妮维雅真的没有区别，护肤的尽头是成分党</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">33:26</a> 告别茶咖，试试星巴克新推出的橄榄油咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> 酸奶界的大冰——B*ueglass，史上最牛喷射套餐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llz08CupPvYK_jMUt5gmR_esr2nx.m4a" length="33721546" type="audio/mp4"/>
